    <string name="connect_title">Connect TMDB</string>
    <string name="connect_line">Shows, films, artwork and trailers come from TMDB, which is free. This TV needs your own TMDB API key, and you can add it from your phone.</string>
    <string name="connect_line_replace">A new key replaces the one this TV uses now. Press Back to keep the current key.</string>
    <string name="connect_steps">1. Scan the code with a phone on the same Wi-Fi as this TV.\n2. On the page that opens, follow the link to get a free key, then paste it in.\n3. That\'s it. The TV checks the key with TMDB and connects.</string>
